# Build output. `lib/` is NOT committed: this repository is designed to be
# installed from a git ref, and pnpm's `_prepare` runs `npm install` (dev
# dependencies included) followed by `prepare` inside the resolved checkout, so
# the host compiles `lib/` itself. Committing build output would instead put a
# file nobody reviews in front of every install, and it would drift from `src/`
# the moment a commit forgot to rebuild. See README "Install from GitHub".
lib/

# Dependencies. `package-lock.json` is committed so an install resolves the
# exact graph this release was built and tested against; `npm ci` reproduces it.
node_modules/

# Packed tarballs from `npm pack`.
*.tgz

# Editor and OS residue.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log

# Local DSH data directories a test run may create (`HOME`, `DSH_HOME`).
.dsh-home/
